07", "authorid": 638, "bench": [638], "title": "Kiran Sinha vs The State Of Bihar & Ors on 7 August, 2014", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "petitioner expresses her willingness to go for <b>compounding</b> in\n\n             terms of  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003. For such\n\n             <b>compounding</b>, the petitioner has admittedly ... been paid along with the\n\n             <b>compounding</b> fee, that means, acquittal under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of the\n\n             <b>Electricity</b> Act.\n \n                               Such is not the position of law. Once", "docsize": 7826, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Patna High Court - Orders", "author": "A Kumar", "authorEncoded": "ashutosh-kumar"}, {"tid": 134637537, "catids": null, "doctype": 1023, "publishdate": "2016-03-15", "authorid": 1552, "bench": [1552], "title": "Pramod Chaudhary vs The State Of Bihar & Ors on 15 March, 2016", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>152</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act,\n\n                  2003, the Company shall proceed for <b>compounding</b> the\n\n                  offence as prescribed under sub-clauses (2) and (3) of\n\n                   <b>Section</b> <b>152</b> ... directed that if the petitioner deposits the\n\n                        <b>compounding</b> fee, as contemplated under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b> (1) \n\n                        of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003, within a period of four", "docsize": 4732, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Patna High Court - Orders", "author": "S P Singh", "authorEncoded": "s-p-singh"}, {"tid": 104385594, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2024-03-29", "authorid": 127, "bench": [127], "title": "Gauri Shankar Chaurasiya @ Jai Gouri ... vs State Of Up And 3 Others on 29 March, 2024", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "petitioner submits that the offence under  <b>Section</b> 135  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act is a <b>compoundable</b> offence under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of Indian <b>Electricity</b> ... <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act.\n  \n 6. Since offence itself is required to be dealt with in accordance with the provisions of  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>", "docsize": 3700, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "M C Tripathi", "authorEncoded": "m-c-tripathi"}, {"tid": 57131613, "catids": [7], "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2023-08-29", "authorid": 82, "bench": [82], "title": "Sameera Aarfa vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 29 August, 2023", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "been lodged on behalf of the <b>Electricity</b> Department levelling allegation of theft of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>Section</b> 135  of <b>Electricity</b> Act.\n  \n 4. It is submitted ... applicant that the commission of offence of theft of <b>electricity</b> is <b>compoundable</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of <b>Electricity</b> Act, therefore, the present applicant may be permitted", "docsize": 3955, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "D Pathak", "authorEncoded": "d-pathak"}, {"tid": 106339641, "catids": [7], "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2023-08-23", "authorid": 82, "bench": [82], "title": "Shri Jiledar vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 23 August, 2023", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "penal provision as enunciated under  <b>Section</b> 138 (B)  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act is <b>compoundable</b> offence under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, therefore, without giving ... move an appropriate application before the authority concerned/<b>Electricity</b> Department for <b>compounding</b> of offence under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act within a period", "docsize": 3539, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "D Pathak", "authorEncoded": "d-pathak"}, {"tid": 14178626, "catids": [7], "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2023-02-06", "authorid": 178, "bench": [178], "title": "Gopal Saran vs State Of U.P. And 2 Other on 6 February, 2023", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "applicant that the nature of offence is <b>compoundable</b>, under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of <b>Electricity</b> Act the procedure of <b>compounding</b> offence has been provided.\n  \n Under the circumstances ... within next three weeks.\n  \n Till the disposal of the <b>compounding</b> application under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of <b>Electricity</b> Act, no coercive action shall be taken against", "docsize": 3132, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "R Chaturvedi", "authorEncoded": "r-chaturvedi"}, {"tid": 12169849, "catids": [7], "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2020-02-13", "authorid": 183, "bench": [183], "title": "Badarooddin vs State Of U.P. And Anr on 13 February, 2020", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "initiated against applicant under  <b>Section</b> 135  of <b>Electricity</b> Act, applicant has deposited the entire amount payable by him towards <b>compounding</b> of the offence alleged ... <b>compoundable</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act.  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b>  of <b>Electricity</b> Act itself provides that upon deposit of <b>compounding</b> fee proceedings shall stand dropped", "docsize": 3778, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "R Misra", "authorEncoded": "r-misra"}, {"tid": 163372658, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2024-11-12", "authorid": null, "bench": [182, 129], "title": "Karan Bahadur Singh vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Home Lko. ... on 12 November, 2024", "numcites": 2, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "this third case is concerned, the offence is <b>compoundable</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>152</b> (3)  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003. The requisite amount was deposited ... finds that the offence has already been <b>compounded</b> then  <b>section</b> 